[[Margonite Bowmaster]]s are found in both the [[Realm of Torment]] and [[Elona]]. They are not very dangerous compared to other Margonites, as the AI can't manage [[Magebane Shot]] well. Since they have no defensive stance to increase their survivability and [[Barbed Arrows]] makes them briefly vulnerable during casting, they fold promptly under physical pressure.

